          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="CellCenter">市內電話</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="CellCenter">電子郵件</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="CellCenter">手機</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="CellCenter">申請資格</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4">
            <text:p text:style-name="Eligibility">申請本貸款，應符合下列規定：</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Eligibility">1. □事業負責人已成年。</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Eligibility">2. 所營事業設於本市滿三個月，且符合下列條件之一者：</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Eligibility">□符合中小企業認定標準第二條，且於本市辦理公司登記、</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Eligibility">　有限公司登記或商業登記之事業，惟不含金融及保險</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Eligibility">　業、特殊娛樂業。</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Eligibility">□於本市辦理合作社登記之公司。</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Eligibility">□依商業登記法第五條規定得免辦理登記之小規模商業，且</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Eligibility">　有稅籍登記者。</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Eligibility">3. □已接受本府原住民個人、機構、法人或團體所營事業諮詢</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Eligibility">　服務。</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Eligibility">4. □已取得原住民機構、法人或團體證明者。</text:p>
          </table:table-cell>
